{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"GHSA-xhj5-c3g8-pfj8","published":"2026-11-10T23:02:40Z","modified":"2026-11-10T23:15:18.038965958Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-109476"],"summary":"Microsoft Security Advisory CVE-2026-109476 - ASP.NET Core Information Disclosure Vulnerability","details":"## Executive summary\n\nMicrosoft is releasing this security advisory to provide information about a vulnerability in ASP.NET Core. This advisory provides guidance on updating affected applications and components.\n\nA crafted `X-Forwarded-Prefix` can inject cookie path delimiters unless PathBase-derived cookie paths percent-encode semicolons.\n\n## Announcement\n\nAnnouncement for this issue can be found at https://github.com/dotnet/announcements/issues/508\n\n## CVSS Details\n\n- **Version:** 3.1\n- **Severity:** Medium\n- **Score:** 6.1 (base score)\n- **Vector:** `CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:H/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:N/A:N/E:U/RL:O/RC:C`\n- **Weakness:** CWE-116\n\n## Affected Platforms\n\n- **Platforms:** Windows, Linux, macOS\n- **Architectures:** All\n\n## <a name=\"affected-packages\"></a>Affected Packages\n\nThe tables list affected version ranges and fixed package versions. Runtime and standalone deliveries are listed separately.\n\n### .NET 8.0 - affected runtime packages\n\nPackage | Affected version | Patched version\n--- | --- | ---\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-x64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-x64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-x64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-x64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.osx-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.osx-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.osx-x64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.osx-x64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-arm64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-x64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-x64) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-x86](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.win-x86) | >= 8.0.0-rc.1.23421.29, <= 8.0.33 | 8.0.34\n\n### .NET 9.0 - affected runtime packages\n\nPackage | Affected version | Patched version\n--- | --- | ---\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm) | >= 9.0.0-preview.1.24081.5, <= 9.0.22 | 9.0.23\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-arm64) | >= 9.0.0-preview.1.24081.5, <= 9.0.22 | 9.0.23\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm) | >= 9.0.0-preview.1.24081.5, <= 9.0.22 | 9.0.23\n[Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64](https://www.nuget.org/packages/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App.Runtime.linux-musl-arm64) | >= 9.0.0-preview.1.24081.5, <= 9.0.22 | 9.0.23\n[